<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.5">
<l>āmaiyāyk kaṅkaiyā yāḻkaṭalā</l>
<l rend="indent">yavaṉiyāya ruvarai kaḷāy</l>
<l>nāṉmukaṉāy nāṉmaṟaiyāy vēḷviyāyt</l>
<l rend="indent">takkaṇaiyāyt tāṉu māṉāṉ</l>
<l>cēmamuṭai nārataṉār ceṉṟuceṉṟu</l>
<l rend="indent">tutittiṟaiñcak kiṭantāṉ kōyil</l>
<l>pūmaruvip puḷḷiṉaṅkaḷ puḷḷaraiyaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">pukaḻkuḻaṟum puṉala raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The temple of him who reclines while joyful Nārada</l>
<l rend="indent">again and again prostrates and praises</l>
<l rend="indent">Him who became the turtle, the Ganges,</l>
<l rend="indent">the deep sea, the earth, the great mountains,</l>
<l rend="indent">the four-faced [Brahmā], the four Vedas,</l>
<l rend="indent">the sacrifices, and the offerings,</l>
<l>is in Araṅkam on the water</l>
<l rend="indent">where flocks of birds come together on flowers</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] sing the praises of the bird-king.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
